			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				772
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phoc.
			</span></i>).</div>
